{
    "background_story": "Cupcake was a vibrant, blue-and-yellow macaw known for her remarkable ability to talk. She lived with her owner, a kind old woman named Mrs. Jenkins, who had rescued her from a neglectful breeder. As Cupcake settled into her new home, she began to mimic Mrs. Jenkins' voice, learning to repeat phrases and even short sentences. But what amazed everyone was Cupcake's capacity for conversation. She would engage in discussions about everything from the weather to her favorite treats, often responding with witty remarks that left visitors in stitches. Cupcake's talent for talk soon made her a local celebrity, with people coming from all over to hear her chat. Despite her fame, Cupcake remained loyal to Mrs. Jenkins, always returning to her cozy perch to share stories of her adventures.",
